Athame has a zero chance so they never appear from random sources.  None
happen as death drops, in shops, on the floor, after a polypile zap.

The only ways to get an athame are as the artifact Magicbane or
characters and monsters that can start with one.  Sacrifice, wish,
bones, either of the two most dangerous types of lich.  It's possible
for the most dangerous lich's dagger to be Magicbane but I have not yet
encountered that in game play.

I've played a small number of games where I spent a wish on "blassed +3
rustproof athame" because I had an otherwise complete ascension kit and
a bunch of wishes available.


